1️⃣ Product Vision

The Compliance Dashboard enables businesses to:

Automatically comply with eTIMS (OSCU)

Sync ERP systems (QuickBooks, Xero, others)

Auto-map tax, classification, and units

Manage branch-level stock

Submit sales & credit notes

Track compliance status in real time

Prevent tax errors before submission

Reconcile automatically with KRA

The system hides OSCU complexity and presents a CFO-friendly interface.

