1️⃣4️⃣ Auto-Mapping Intelligence Flow

When new ERP item detected:

Run classification engine

Run tax percentage match

Suggest unit mapping

Compute confidence score

If confidence > 85%:
Auto-approve (optional setting)

If < 85%:
Flag for review

CFO Setting:

“Allow auto-approval for high confidence mappings”

